abstract: "Research project developed by Florian Rascoussier during his PhD, extending the time-dependent vehicle routing solver of Lera-Romero, Miranda-Bront and Soulignac. The implementation and numerical validation work in this fork served as direct groundwork for KAYROS (https://github.com/0nyr/kayros)."
